  m_text: 'Surface Reflection - Windows


    Large glass surfaces cause critical
    light refraction. This creates spatial mapping errors and may lead to serious
    SLAM tracking drift or complete loss of orientation. Avoid scanning directly
    towards the window or cover the surface.'
